  "commit_message": "Fix AttributeError on LinearAttentionLayer in export generate test (#50140)\n\n`b5e1cb8b` (Add Mistral Large 4) added a check in `ExportGenerateTesterMixin`\nthat accesses `layer.is_initialized` on all cache layers. `DynamicLayer` has\nthis attribute, but `LinearAttentionLayer` does not — it uses\n`is_conv_states_initialized` / `is_recurrent_states_initialized` instead.\n\nGuard with `hasattr` to avoid the AttributeError on hybrid models whose cache\ncontains `LinearAttentionLayer` instances (minicpm_oc",
